USE GRAPH Mule_Pattern_Learner

/* The device and IP graph, B5 (docs/design.md, "read_shared_identity (B5): the device and IP
   graph", and docs/features.md, "What one example's subgraph holds", items 3 and 5 to 9, and
   the customer, device, IP, enrolment and seen tables): for each account of the request at one
   Monday t, the customers, devices and IPs of its subgraph, and its enrolment, owner-enrolment
   and seen edges, each with its fields.

   The subgraph's accounts are read_payment_events' (B4), found here again by the same rules,
   since an expanded hop-1 account brings its customer's devices and IPs: s, the scored
   account; its hop-1 accounts, of which those that are no hub are expanded; their hop-2
   accounts; and up to 8 other accounts of s's customer C_s.

   - D_s: C_s's visible enrolment links, up to 8 devices and 8 IPs, by their newest evidence,
     the later of the link's known start and the latest payment seen on the node from an
     account C_s owns, then by node id; a link with neither comes last. Each expanded hop-1
     account's customer keeps its links by the same rule. A customer's visible links to one
     node are one link, whose start is the earliest of theirs.
   - S_s: the devices and IPs seen on s's payments sent in the lookback, up to 8 of each,
     latest use first, then by node id; each expanded hop-1 account keeps its own the same
     way.
   - The leaves: every device and IP is tested inline by read_hubs' crowd rule, its customers
     with a visible enrolment link and the owners, through a visible ownership link, of
     deposit accounts that exist at t and sent a payment seen on it in the lookback. One with
     more than 8 is a leaf: it stays as a node with its leaf flag, is never expanded, and
     counts for no sharing.
   - Co-users: the customers other than C_s counted on a node of D_s or S_s that is no leaf;
     the newest 48 per scored account by their newest evidence on those nodes, the later of a
     known link start and the latest use seen from a deposit account, t - 90 days with
     neither, then by customer id. Each brings one deposit account that exists at t through a
     visible ownership link: the one seen last on those nodes, else the one with the latest
     payment in the lookback, else the one with none, then by account id. A co-user with a
     visible link to one of those nodes is a customer node of the subgraph.
   - The customers of the subgraph: C_s, each expanded hop-1 account's customer and the
     co-users with a link; its devices and IPs: D_s, S_s and each expanded hop-1 account's.
   - Edges: enrolment from C_s to D_s; owner-enrolment from every account of C_s in the
     subgraph to D_s, and from each expanded hop-1 account to its customer's kept links; seen
     edges from s to S_s and from each expanded hop-1 account to its own; and around every
     node of D_s and S_s that is no leaf, every enrolment, owner-enrolment and seen edge
     between it and a customer or an account of the subgraph. A hub account other than s has
     none.

   A start s of a customer on a node, a link's start or its first use seen in the lookback, is
   known when s > t - 90 days, s > its joined_ms, and an account it owns through a visible
   ownership link sent a payment in [t - 90 days, s) not seen on that node. A customer shares
   a node that is no leaf when it has a link to it held in the last 30 days, or a deposit
   account it owns, existing at t through a visible ownership link, sent a payment seen on it
   in the last 30 days. Its sharing start there is the earliest of its link start and its
   first use seen from such an account, each t - 90 days when it is not known; two customers
   began sharing a node at the later of their starts, and began sharing at the earliest of
   those over the nodes they share.

   The rows and edge fields are those of docs/features.md; each duration that may be absent is
   printed as presence and milliseconds. No link end is a value: valid_to_ms appears only in
   the visible and current tests. A self-payment is read nowhere but in the crowd count,
   which is read_hubs' measure.

   Per-request state is kept by the scored account: on its own vertex, or in maps keyed by its
   id. Every other map holds what one customer, account, node or payment is at t, whichever
   scored account reached it. The account hubs of t come as hub_accounts, read_hubs' account
   hubs of the same t; each must exist at t. Reads no label. t must be a Monday at 00:00 UTC
   after the lookback's length, and the request must name at least one account, each once,
   each in the graph and existing at t; the accounts come as ids, as read_money_flow says
   why. */
CREATE OR REPLACE QUERY read_shared_identity(
    UINT t_ms,
    LIST<STRING> account_ids,
    SET<VERTEX<Account>> hub_accounts
) FOR GRAPH Mule_Pattern_Learner SYNTAX V2 {
    /* B4's capped payment and other account of a customer; a kept link, seen node or co-user
       by its evidence and id; the three kinds of edge printed. */
    TYPEDEF TUPLE<INT sec, STRING id, STRING other> Picked;
    TYPEDEF TUPLE<INT sec, STRING id> Sibling;
    TYPEDEF TUPLE<UINT ts, STRING id> Ranked;
    TYPEDEF TUPLE<
        STRING customer_id,
        STRING node_id,
        BOOL since_start_present,
        UINT since_start_ms,
        BOOL since_last_seen_present,
        UINT since_last_seen_ms
    > Enrolled;
    TYPEDEF TUPLE<
        STRING account_id,
        STRING node_id,
        BOOL since_start_present,
        UINT since_start_ms,
        BOOL since_last_seen_present,
        UINT since_last_seen_ms
    > OwnerEnrolled;
    TYPEDEF TUPLE<
        STRING account_id,
        STRING node_id,
        INT uses_90d,
        BOOL since_first_use_present,
        UINT since_first_use_ms,
        UINT since_last_use_ms
    > Seen;
    /* B4's accounts: the account hubs, the capped payments and the other accounts. */
    OrAccum @hub, @expanding;
    HeapAccum<Picked>(32, sec DESC, id ASC) @scored_out, @scored_in;
    HeapAccum<Picked>(16, sec DESC, id ASC) @other_out, @other_in;
    MaxAccum<UINT> @last_active;
    HeapAccum<Sibling>(8, sec DESC, id ASC) @siblings;
    /* A customer's kept links; an expanded account's kept seen nodes; a scored account's
       co-user candidates by evidence and its kept co-users. */
    HeapAccum<Ranked>(8, ts DESC, id ASC) @kept_devices, @kept_ips, @kept_seen_devices,
      @kept_seen_ips;
    MapAccum<STRING, MaxAccum<UINT>> @candidate_evidence;
    HeapAccum<Ranked>(48, ts DESC, id ASC) @kept_co_users;
    /* A payment's sender; its sender's owner, a customer of a row or another user, and
       whether that is a deposit account; its receiver; and the nodes it was seen on. */
    MaxAccum<STRING> @sender_id, @owner_id, @user_id, @receiver_id;
    OrAccum @deposit_sender;
    SetAccum<STRING> @seen_on;
    /* A node's crowd count, its leaf flag, and its activity of the last 30 days. A node
       first reached through a customer of a row has a count of its own, since its row is
       never printed. */
    SetAccum<VERTEX<Party>> @crowd_customers, @crowd_enrolled, @crowd_reached;
    OrAccum @leaf;
    SetAccum<STRING> @seen_accounts;
    /* A customer's co-users: when each pair began sharing, and on which kinds of node. */
    MapAccum<STRING, MinAccum<UINT>> @pair_start;
    SetAccum<STRING> @device_co_users, @ip_co_users;
    /* The rows: a customer's, and a device's or IP's. */
    SumAccum<INT> @accounts_owned, @devices_30d, @ips_30d, @new_devices_30d, @new_ips_30d,
      @co_users, @new_co_users_30d, @co_users_both;
    SumAccum<INT> @customers_30d, @customers_90d, @new_customers_7d, @new_customers_30d,
      @accounts_seen_30d, @payments_seen_30d;
    OrAccum @observed_only;
    /* B4's accounts per scored account, the hop-1 accounts and whom they were reached by,
       the expanded ones per scored account, the account hubs, and each expanded account's
       customer; the accounts of C_s in each subgraph. */
    MapAccum<STRING, SetAccum<STRING>> @@subgraph_accounts, @@reached_by, @@expanded_of,
      @@customer_accounts;
    SetAccum<STRING> @@hop1_ids, @@hub_ids;
    MapAccum<STRING, MaxAccum<STRING>> @@owner_of;
    /* Per account and node, its payments sent in the lookback seen on the node: how many,
       the first and the last; the nodes whose first use is a known start; per node, the
       accounts seen on it. */
    MapAccum<STRING, MapAccum<STRING, SumAccum<INT>>> @@uses;
    MapAccum<STRING, MapAccum<STRING, MinAccum<UINT>>> @@first_use;
    MapAccum<STRING, MapAccum<STRING, MaxAccum<UINT>>> @@last_use;
    MapAccum<STRING, SetAccum<STRING>> @@first_use_known, @@node_senders;
    SetAccum<STRING> @@seen_account_ids;
    /* Per customer and node: the earliest start of its visible links, and the known one;
       whether one is held in the last 30 days; its latest payment seen on the node from an
       account it owns; its first and latest from a deposit account, and whether one was in
       the last 30 days; its sharing start. */
    MapAccum<STRING, MapAccum<STRING, MinAccum<UINT>>> @@link_start, @@known_link, @@dep_first,
      @@share_start;
    MapAccum<STRING, MapAccum<STRING, MaxAccum<UINT>>> @@any_last, @@dep_last;
    MapAccum<STRING, SetAccum<STRING>> @@link_current, @@dep_recent;
    /* Per customer, for the known-start test: its earliest payment in the lookback, the nodes
       its payments were seen on, and per such node its earliest payment not seen there. */
    MapAccum<STRING, MinAccum<UINT>> @@first_own;
    MapAccum<STRING, SetAccum<STRING>> @@own_seen;
    MapAccum<STRING, MapAccum<STRING, MinAccum<UINT>>> @@first_unseen;
    /* The nodes: which are IPs, which are leaves, which some customer of a row shares; per
       node, the scored accounts it may be a node of, its co-user candidates, its users, and
       the accounts whose customer has a visible link to it, with that customer. */
    SetAccum<STRING> @@ip_ids, @@leaf_ids, @@shared_ids;
    MapAccum<STRING, SetAccum<STRING>> @@node_scored, @@candidates, @@node_users;
    MapAccum<STRING, MapAccum<STRING, MaxAccum<STRING>>> @@node_link_accounts;
    /* Per customer, its deposit accounts; per co-user's deposit account, its latest payment;
       per customer and per expanded account, its kept nodes; per scored account, its nodes
       that are no leaf and its kept co-users. */
    MapAccum<STRING, SetAccum<STRING>> @@deposit_accounts, @@kept_links, @@kept_seen, @@s_open,
      @@kept_co_users;
    SetAccum<STRING> @@co_user_deposit_ids;
    MapAccum<STRING, MaxAccum<UINT>> @@last_active;
    /* The answer: per scored account its customers, nodes and co-users' accounts, and its
       edges; the customers, nodes and accounts printed. */
    MapAccum<STRING, SetAccum<STRING>> @@subgraph_customers, @@subgraph_nodes,
      @@co_user_accounts, @@s_accounts;
    MapAccum<STRING, SetAccum<Enrolled>> @@enrolled;
    MapAccum<STRING, SetAccum<OwnerEnrolled>> @@owner_enrolled;
    MapAccum<STRING, SetAccum<Seen>> @@seen;
    SetAccum<STRING> @@printed_customers, @@printed_nodes, @@printed_accounts;
    /* The request's ids, each once, and how many it gave. */
    SetAccum<STRING> @@ids;
    SumAccum<INT> @@given;
    UINT lookback_ms = 7776000000;
    UINT crowd_threshold = 8;

    /* Mondays are 4 days after the Thursday of 1970-01-01, modulo a week. */
    IF t_ms <= lookback_ms OR t_ms % 604800000 != 345600000 THEN
        PRINT "invalid_parameters" AS status;
        RETURN;
    END;
    FOREACH account_id IN account_ids DO
        @@ids += account_id;
        @@given += 1;
    END;
    IF @@given == 0 THEN
        PRINT "invalid_parameters" AS status;
        RETURN;
    END;
    IF @@ids.size() != @@given THEN
        PRINT "duplicate_account" AS status;
        RETURN;
    END;
    Requested = to_vertex_set(@@ids, "Account");
    IF Requested.size() != @@ids.size() THEN
        PRINT "unknown_account" AS status;
        RETURN;
    END;
    Scored = SELECT s FROM Requested:s WHERE s.opened_ms < t_ms;
    IF Scored.size() != Requested.size() THEN
        PRINT "invisible_account" AS status;
        RETURN;
    END;
    Hubs = {hub_accounts};
    HubAccounts = SELECT h FROM Hubs:h WHERE h.opened_ms < t_ms;
    IF HubAccounts.size() != Hubs.size() THEN
        PRINT "invisible_hub" AS status;
        RETURN;
    END;
    Marked = SELECT h FROM HubAccounts:h POST-ACCUM h.@hub += TRUE, @@hub_ids += h.id;

    /* B4's accounts of every subgraph, by B4's rules. */
    ScoredSent = SELECT a FROM Scored:a
      -((Account_Initiated_Transaction>|Account_Sent_Zelle_Transfer>):e)-
      (Payment_Transaction|Zelle_Transfer):p
      -((Transaction_To_Account>|Transfer_To_Account>):f)- Account:b
      WHERE p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - lookback_ms AND p.event_ts_ms < t_ms AND b != a
      ACCUM a.@scored_out += Picked(floor(p.event_ts_ms / 1000), p.id, b.id);
    ScoredReceived = SELECT a FROM Scored:a
      -((Account_Received_Transaction>|Account_Received_Zelle_Transfer>):e)-
      (Payment_Transaction|Zelle_Transfer):p
      -((Transaction_From_Account>|Transfer_From_Account>):f)- Account:b
      WHERE p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - lookback_ms AND p.event_ts_ms < t_ms AND b != a
      ACCUM a.@scored_in += Picked(floor(p.event_ts_ms / 1000), p.id, b.id);
    ScoredPicked = SELECT a FROM Scored:a
      POST-ACCUM
        @@subgraph_accounts += (a.id -> a.id),
        FOREACH x IN a.@scored_out DO
            @@subgraph_accounts += (a.id -> x.other),
            @@hop1_ids += x.other,
            @@reached_by += (x.other -> a.id)
        END,
        FOREACH x IN a.@scored_in DO
            @@subgraph_accounts += (a.id -> x.other),
            @@hop1_ids += x.other,
            @@reached_by += (x.other -> a.id)
        END;
    Hop1Listed = to_vertex_set(@@hop1_ids, "Account");
    Hop1 = SELECT c FROM Hop1Listed:c WHERE c.opened_ms < t_ms AND NOT c.@hub;
    Hop1Sent = SELECT c FROM Hop1:c
      -((Account_Initiated_Transaction>|Account_Sent_Zelle_Transfer>):e)-
      (Payment_Transaction|Zelle_Transfer):p
      -((Transaction_To_Account>|Transfer_To_Account>):f)- Account:b
      WHERE p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - lookback_ms AND p.event_ts_ms < t_ms AND b != c
      ACCUM c.@other_out += Picked(floor(p.event_ts_ms / 1000), p.id, b.id);
    Hop1Received = SELECT c FROM Hop1:c
      -((Account_Received_Transaction>|Account_Received_Zelle_Transfer>):e)-
      (Payment_Transaction|Zelle_Transfer):p
      -((Transaction_From_Account>|Transfer_From_Account>):f)- Account:b
      WHERE p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - lookback_ms AND p.event_ts_ms < t_ms AND b != c
      ACCUM c.@other_in += Picked(floor(p.event_ts_ms / 1000), p.id, b.id);
    Hop1Picked = SELECT c FROM Hop1:c
      POST-ACCUM
        FOREACH i IN @@reached_by.get(c.id) DO @@expanded_of += (i -> c.id) END,
        FOREACH x IN c.@other_out DO
            FOREACH i IN @@reached_by.get(c.id) DO @@subgraph_accounts += (i -> x.other) END
        END,
        FOREACH x IN c.@other_in DO
            FOREACH i IN @@reached_by.get(c.id) DO @@subgraph_accounts += (i -> x.other) END
        END;
    Siblings = SELECT b FROM Scored:a -(Account_Owned_By_Party>:o)- Party:q
      -(Party_Owns_Account>:w)- Account:b
      WHERE o.valid_from_ms < t_ms
        AND (o.valid_to_ms == 0 OR o.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
        AND w.valid_from_ms < t_ms
        AND (w.valid_to_ms == 0 OR w.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
        AND b.opened_ms < t_ms AND b != a;
    Active = SELECT b FROM Siblings:b
      -((Account_Initiated_Transaction>|Account_Received_Transaction>
        |Account_Sent_Zelle_Transfer>|Account_Received_Zelle_Transfer>):e)-
      (Payment_Transaction|Zelle_Transfer):p
      -((Transaction_From_Account>|Transaction_To_Account>
        |Transfer_From_Account>|Transfer_To_Account>):f)- Account:x
      WHERE p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - lookback_ms AND p.event_ts_ms < t_ms AND x != b
      ACCUM b.@last_active += p.event_ts_ms;
    SiblingPicks = SELECT a FROM Scored:a -(Account_Owned_By_Party>:o)- Party:q
      -(Party_Owns_Account>:w)- Account:b
      WHERE o.valid_from_ms < t_ms
        AND (o.valid_to_ms == 0 OR o.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
        AND w.valid_from_ms < t_ms
        AND (w.valid_to_ms == 0 OR w.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
        AND b.opened_ms < t_ms AND b != a
      ACCUM a.@siblings += Sibling(floor(b.@last_active / 1000), b.id);
    SiblingsPicked = SELECT a FROM Scored:a
      POST-ACCUM
        FOREACH x IN a.@siblings DO @@subgraph_accounts += (a.id -> x.id) END;
    CustomerAccounts = SELECT a FROM Scored:a -(Account_Owned_By_Party>:o)- Party:q
      -(Party_Owns_Account>:w)- Account:b
      WHERE o.valid_from_ms < t_ms
        AND (o.valid_to_ms == 0 OR o.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
        AND w.valid_from_ms < t_ms
        AND (w.valid_to_ms == 0 OR w.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
        AND b.opened_ms < t_ms
      ACCUM
        IF @@subgraph_accounts.get(a.id).contains(b.id) THEN
            @@customer_accounts += (a.id -> b.id)
        END;

    /* The expanded accounts, the scored ones and the hop-1 accounts that are no hub, and
       their customers. */
    Expanding = Scored UNION Hop1;
    ExpandingMarked = SELECT a FROM Expanding:a POST-ACCUM a.@expanding += TRUE;
    Owners = SELECT q FROM Expanding:a -(Account_Owned_By_Party>:o)- Party:q
      WHERE o.valid_from_ms < t_ms
        AND (o.valid_to_ms == 0 OR o.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
      ACCUM @@owner_of += (a.id -> q.id);

    /* The devices and IPs seen on the expanded accounts' payments sent in the lookback, but
       self-payments, and the visible links of their customers. */
    ExpandingSent = SELECT p FROM Expanding:a
      -((Account_Initiated_Transaction>|Account_Sent_Zelle_Transfer>):e)-
      (Payment_Transaction|Zelle_Transfer):p
      -((Transaction_To_Account>|Transfer_To_Account>):f)- Account:b
      WHERE p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - lookback_ms AND p.event_ts_ms < t_ms AND b != a
      ACCUM p.@sender_id += a.id;
    ExpandingSeen = SELECT n FROM ExpandingSent:p
      -((Transaction_Used_Device>|Transaction_Used_IP>
        |Transfer_Used_Device>|Transfer_Used_IP>):u)- (Device|IP):n
      ACCUM
        @@uses += (p.@sender_id -> (n.id -> 1)),
        @@first_use += (p.@sender_id -> (n.id -> p.event_ts_ms)),
        @@last_use += (p.@sender_id -> (n.id -> p.event_ts_ms)),
        @@node_senders += (n.id -> p.@sender_id),
        @@seen_account_ids += p.@sender_id,
        IF n.type == "IP" THEN @@ip_ids += n.id END;
    OwnerLinks = SELECT n FROM Owners:q -((Party_Uses_Device>|Party_Uses_IP>):l)- (Device|IP):n
      WHERE l.valid_from_ms < t_ms
        AND (l.valid_to_ms == 0 OR l.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
      ACCUM
        @@link_start += (q.id -> (n.id -> l.valid_from_ms)),
        IF l.valid_from_ms < t_ms
          AND (l.valid_to_ms == 0 OR l.valid_to_ms > t_ms - 2592000000) THEN
            @@link_current += (q.id -> n.id),
            @@shared_ids += n.id
        END,
        IF n.type == "IP" THEN @@ip_ids += n.id END;

    /* The leaves among them, by read_hubs' crowd rule; payments are read only for a node
       that 8 enrolled customers or fewer do not already make a leaf. */
    Discovered = ExpandingSeen UNION OwnerLinks;
    EnrolledCrowd = SELECT d FROM Discovered:d
      -((Device_Used_By_Party>|IP_Used_By_Party>):l)- Party:q
      WHERE l.valid_from_ms < t_ms
        AND (l.valid_to_ms == 0 OR l.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
      ACCUM d.@crowd_customers += q, d.@crowd_enrolled += q;
    SeenCrowd = SELECT d FROM Discovered:d
      -((Device_Used_By_Transaction>|IP_Observed_In_Transaction>
        |Device_Used_By_Transfer>|IP_Used_By_Transfer>):u)-
      (Payment_Transaction|Zelle_Transfer):p
      -((Transaction_From_Account>|Transfer_From_Account>):f)- Account:b
      -(Account_Owned_By_Party>:o)- Party:q
      WHERE d.@crowd_customers.size() <= crowd_threshold
        AND p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - lookback_ms AND p.event_ts_ms < t_ms
        AND b.account_type == "deposit" AND b.opened_ms < t_ms
        AND o.valid_from_ms < t_ms
        AND (o.valid_to_ms == 0 OR o.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
      ACCUM d.@crowd_customers += q;
    Leaves = SELECT d FROM Discovered:d
      POST-ACCUM d.@leaf += d.@crowd_customers.size() > crowd_threshold;
    LeafIds = SELECT d FROM Discovered:d WHERE d.@leaf POST-ACCUM @@leaf_ids += d.id;

    /* Each scored account's nodes before the caps, C_s's links and those seen on s's
       payments; the customers counted on those that are no leaf are its co-user
       candidates, by the crowd rule. */
    ScoredNodes = SELECT a FROM Scored:a
      POST-ACCUM
        FOREACH (n, last_ms) IN @@last_use.get(a.id) DO @@node_scored += (n -> a.id) END,
        FOREACH (n, start_ms) IN @@link_start.get(@@owner_of.get(a.id)) DO
            @@node_scored += (n -> a.id)
        END;
    SNodes = SELECT d FROM Discovered:d WHERE NOT d.@leaf AND @@node_scored.containsKey(d.id);
    LinkedCandidates = SELECT q FROM SNodes:d
      -((Device_Used_By_Party>|IP_Used_By_Party>):l)- Party:q
      WHERE NOT d.@leaf AND l.valid_from_ms < t_ms
        AND (l.valid_to_ms == 0 OR l.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
      ACCUM @@candidates += (d.id -> q.id);
    SeenCandidates = SELECT q FROM SNodes:d
      -((Device_Used_By_Transaction>|IP_Observed_In_Transaction>
        |Device_Used_By_Transfer>|IP_Used_By_Transfer>):u)-
      (Payment_Transaction|Zelle_Transfer):p
      -((Transaction_From_Account>|Transfer_From_Account>):f)- Account:b
      -(Account_Owned_By_Party>:o)- Party:q
      WHERE NOT d.@leaf
        AND p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - lookback_ms AND p.event_ts_ms < t_ms
        AND b.account_type == "deposit" AND b.opened_ms < t_ms
        AND o.valid_from_ms < t_ms
        AND (o.valid_to_ms == 0 OR o.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
      ACCUM @@candidates += (d.id -> q.id);
    Candidates = LinkedCandidates UNION SeenCandidates;

    /* The customers that may get a row: the expanded accounts' customers and the co-user
       candidates. Their links, their accounts, and their payments sent in the lookback, but
       self-payments, with the nodes each was seen on. */
    RowCustomers = Owners UNION Candidates;
    NewRows = Candidates MINUS Owners;
    RowLinks = SELECT n FROM NewRows:q -((Party_Uses_Device>|Party_Uses_IP>):l)- (Device|IP):n
      WHERE l.valid_from_ms < t_ms
        AND (l.valid_to_ms == 0 OR l.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
      ACCUM
        @@link_start += (q.id -> (n.id -> l.valid_from_ms)),
        IF l.valid_from_ms < t_ms
          AND (l.valid_to_ms == 0 OR l.valid_to_ms > t_ms - 2592000000) THEN
            @@link_current += (q.id -> n.id),
            @@shared_ids += n.id
        END,
        IF n.type == "IP" THEN @@ip_ids += n.id END;
    RowAccounts = SELECT b FROM RowCustomers:q -(Party_Owns_Account>:w)- Account:b
      WHERE w.valid_from_ms < t_ms
        AND (w.valid_to_ms == 0 OR w.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
        AND b.opened_ms < t_ms
      ACCUM
        q.@accounts_owned += 1,
        IF b.account_type == "deposit" THEN @@deposit_accounts += (q.id -> b.id) END;
    RowSent = SELECT p FROM RowCustomers:q -(Party_Owns_Account>:w)- Account:b
      -((Account_Initiated_Transaction>|Account_Sent_Zelle_Transfer>):e)-
      (Payment_Transaction|Zelle_Transfer):p
      -((Transaction_To_Account>|Transfer_To_Account>):f)- Account:r
      WHERE w.valid_from_ms < t_ms
        AND (w.valid_to_ms == 0 OR w.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
        AND b.opened_ms < t_ms
        AND p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - lookback_ms AND p.event_ts_ms < t_ms AND r != b
      ACCUM
        p.@owner_id += q.id,
        p.@deposit_sender += b.account_type == "deposit",
        @@first_own += (q.id -> p.event_ts_ms);
    RowSeen = SELECT n FROM RowSent:p
      -((Transaction_Used_Device>|Transaction_Used_IP>
        |Transfer_Used_Device>|Transfer_Used_IP>):u)- (Device|IP):n
      ACCUM
        p.@seen_on += n.id,
        @@own_seen += (p.@owner_id -> n.id),
        @@any_last += (p.@owner_id -> (n.id -> p.event_ts_ms)),
        IF p.@deposit_sender THEN
            @@dep_first += (p.@owner_id -> (n.id -> p.event_ts_ms)),
            @@dep_last += (p.@owner_id -> (n.id -> p.event_ts_ms)),
            IF p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - 2592000000 THEN
                @@dep_recent += (p.@owner_id -> n.id),
                @@shared_ids += n.id
            END
        END,
        IF n.type == "IP" THEN @@ip_ids += n.id END;

    /* The leaves among the nodes those customers share that were not tested yet. */
    Reached = RowLinks UNION RowSeen;
    SharedReached = SELECT n FROM Reached:n WHERE @@shared_ids.contains(n.id);
    Untested = SharedReached MINUS Discovered;
    UntestedEnrolledCrowd = SELECT d FROM Untested:d
      -((Device_Used_By_Party>|IP_Used_By_Party>):l)- Party:q
      WHERE l.valid_from_ms < t_ms
        AND (l.valid_to_ms == 0 OR l.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
      ACCUM d.@crowd_reached += q;
    UntestedSeenCrowd = SELECT d FROM Untested:d
      -((Device_Used_By_Transaction>|IP_Observed_In_Transaction>
        |Device_Used_By_Transfer>|IP_Used_By_Transfer>):u)-
      (Payment_Transaction|Zelle_Transfer):p
      -((Transaction_From_Account>|Transfer_From_Account>):f)- Account:b
      -(Account_Owned_By_Party>:o)- Party:q
      WHERE d.@crowd_reached.size() <= crowd_threshold
        AND p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - lookback_ms AND p.event_ts_ms < t_ms
        AND b.account_type == "deposit" AND b.opened_ms < t_ms
        AND o.valid_from_ms < t_ms
        AND (o.valid_to_ms == 0 OR o.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
      ACCUM d.@crowd_reached += q;
    UntestedLeaves = SELECT d FROM Untested:d
      POST-ACCUM d.@leaf += d.@crowd_reached.size() > crowd_threshold;
    UntestedLeafIds = SELECT d FROM Untested:d WHERE d.@leaf POST-ACCUM @@leaf_ids += d.id;

    /* Every node tested that is no leaf: the receiver of each payment seen on it in the
       lookback; then its users, through a visible link or a payment, but self-payments, from
       an account they own through a visible ownership link; its activity of the last 30
       days; and, on a scored account's node, every account seen on it and every account
       whose customer has a visible link to it. */
    Tested = Discovered UNION Untested;
    Open = SELECT d FROM Tested:d WHERE NOT d.@leaf;
    OpenReceivers = SELECT p FROM Open:d
      -((Device_Used_By_Transaction>|IP_Observed_In_Transaction>
        |Device_Used_By_Transfer>|IP_Used_By_Transfer>):u)-
      (Payment_Transaction|Zelle_Transfer):p
      -((Transaction_To_Account>|Transfer_To_Account>):f)- Account:r
      WHERE NOT d.@leaf AND p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - lookback_ms AND p.event_ts_ms < t_ms
      ACCUM p.@receiver_id += r.id;
    LinkUsers = SELECT q FROM Open:d -((Device_Used_By_Party>|IP_Used_By_Party>):l)- Party:q
      WHERE NOT d.@leaf AND l.valid_from_ms < t_ms
        AND (l.valid_to_ms == 0 OR l.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
      ACCUM
        @@link_start += (q.id -> (d.id -> l.valid_from_ms)),
        IF l.valid_from_ms < t_ms
          AND (l.valid_to_ms == 0 OR l.valid_to_ms > t_ms - 2592000000) THEN
            @@link_current += (q.id -> d.id)
        END,
        @@node_users += (d.id -> q.id);
    SeenUsers = SELECT q FROM Open:d
      -((Device_Used_By_Transaction>|IP_Observed_In_Transaction>
        |Device_Used_By_Transfer>|IP_Used_By_Transfer>):u)-
      (Payment_Transaction|Zelle_Transfer):p
      -((Transaction_From_Account>|Transfer_From_Account>):f)- Account:b
      -(Account_Owned_By_Party>:o)- Party:q
      WHERE NOT d.@leaf
        AND p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - lookback_ms AND p.event_ts_ms < t_ms
        AND b.opened_ms < t_ms AND b.id != p.@receiver_id
        AND o.valid_from_ms < t_ms
        AND (o.valid_to_ms == 0 OR o.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
      ACCUM
        @@any_last += (q.id -> (d.id -> p.event_ts_ms)),
        IF b.account_type == "deposit" THEN
            @@dep_first += (q.id -> (d.id -> p.event_ts_ms)),
            @@dep_last += (q.id -> (d.id -> p.event_ts_ms)),
            @@node_users += (d.id -> q.id),
            IF p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - 2592000000 THEN @@dep_recent += (q.id -> d.id) END
        END;
    OpenActivity = SELECT d FROM Open:d
      -((Device_Used_By_Transaction>|IP_Observed_In_Transaction>
        |Device_Used_By_Transfer>|IP_Used_By_Transfer>):u)-
      (Payment_Transaction|Zelle_Transfer):p
      -((Transaction_From_Account>|Transfer_From_Account>):f)- Account:b
      WHERE NOT d.@leaf
        AND p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - lookback_ms AND p.event_ts_ms < t_ms
        AND b.id != p.@receiver_id
      ACCUM
        IF p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - 2592000000 THEN
            d.@seen_accounts += b.id,
            d.@payments_seen_30d += 1
        END,
        IF NOT b.@expanding AND @@node_scored.containsKey(d.id) THEN
            @@uses += (b.id -> (d.id -> 1)),
            @@first_use += (b.id -> (d.id -> p.event_ts_ms)),
            @@last_use += (b.id -> (d.id -> p.event_ts_ms)),
            @@node_senders += (d.id -> b.id),
            @@seen_account_ids += b.id
        END;
    LinkedAccounts = SELECT b FROM SNodes:d -((Device_Used_By_Party>|IP_Used_By_Party>):l)-
      Party:q -(Party_Owns_Account>:w)- Account:b
      WHERE NOT d.@leaf AND l.valid_from_ms < t_ms
        AND (l.valid_to_ms == 0 OR l.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
        AND w.valid_from_ms < t_ms
        AND (w.valid_to_ms == 0 OR w.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
        AND b.opened_ms < t_ms
      ACCUM @@node_link_accounts += (d.id -> (b.id -> q.id));

    /* The known-start test needs each user's payments sent in the lookback, but
       self-payments, and the nodes each was seen on; the customers of a row have theirs. */
    Users = LinkUsers UNION SeenUsers;
    OtherUsers = Users MINUS RowCustomers;
    OtherSent = SELECT p FROM OtherUsers:q -(Party_Owns_Account>:w)- Account:b
      -((Account_Initiated_Transaction>|Account_Sent_Zelle_Transfer>):e)-
      (Payment_Transaction|Zelle_Transfer):p
      -((Transaction_To_Account>|Transfer_To_Account>):f)- Account:r
      WHERE w.valid_from_ms < t_ms
        AND (w.valid_to_ms == 0 OR w.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
        AND b.opened_ms < t_ms
        AND p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - lookback_ms AND p.event_ts_ms < t_ms AND r != b
      ACCUM
        p.@user_id += q.id,
        @@first_own += (q.id -> p.event_ts_ms);
    OtherSeen = SELECT n FROM OtherSent:p
      -((Transaction_Used_Device>|Transaction_Used_IP>
        |Transfer_Used_Device>|Transfer_Used_IP>):u)- (Device|IP):n
      ACCUM
        p.@seen_on += n.id,
        @@own_seen += (p.@user_id -> n.id);
    RowUnseen = SELECT p FROM RowSent:p
      POST-ACCUM
        FOREACH n IN @@own_seen.get(p.@owner_id) DO
            IF NOT p.@seen_on.contains(n) THEN
                @@first_unseen += (p.@owner_id -> (n -> p.event_ts_ms))
            END
        END;
    OtherUnseen = SELECT p FROM OtherSent:p
      POST-ACCUM
        FOREACH n IN @@own_seen.get(p.@user_id) DO
            IF NOT p.@seen_on.contains(n) THEN
                @@first_unseen += (p.@user_id -> (n -> p.event_ts_ms))
            END
        END;

    /* Each user's starts: a link start or a first use from a deposit account is known when
       it is after the lookback's start, after the customer joined, and after a payment of the
       customer's own not seen on the node; the sharing start is the earliest of them, each
       t - 90 days when not known. */
    AllUsers = RowCustomers UNION Users;
    Starts = SELECT q FROM AllUsers:q
      POST-ACCUM
        UINT unseen_ms = 0, BOOL found = FALSE,
        FOREACH (n, start_ms) IN @@link_start.get(q.id) DO
            IF @@own_seen.get(q.id).contains(n) THEN
                found = @@first_unseen.get(q.id).containsKey(n),
                unseen_ms = @@first_unseen.get(q.id).get(n)
            ELSE
                found = @@first_own.containsKey(q.id),
                unseen_ms = @@first_own.get(q.id)
            END,
            IF start_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms AND start_ms > q.joined_ms
              AND found AND unseen_ms < start_ms THEN
                @@known_link += (q.id -> (n -> start_ms)),
                @@share_start += (q.id -> (n -> start_ms))
            ELSE
                @@share_start += (q.id -> (n -> t_ms - lookback_ms))
            END
        END,
        FOREACH (n, start_ms) IN @@dep_first.get(q.id) DO
            IF @@own_seen.get(q.id).contains(n) THEN
                found = @@first_unseen.get(q.id).containsKey(n),
                unseen_ms = @@first_unseen.get(q.id).get(n)
            ELSE
                found = @@first_own.containsKey(q.id),
                unseen_ms = @@first_own.get(q.id)
            END,
            IF start_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms AND start_ms > q.joined_ms
              AND found AND unseen_ms < start_ms THEN
                @@share_start += (q.id -> (n -> start_ms))
            ELSE
                @@share_start += (q.id -> (n -> t_ms - lookback_ms))
            END
        END;
    SeenAccounts = to_vertex_set(@@seen_account_ids, "Account");
    FirstUses = SELECT a FROM SeenAccounts:a -(Account_Owned_By_Party>:o)- Party:q
      WHERE a.opened_ms < t_ms AND o.valid_from_ms < t_ms
        AND (o.valid_to_ms == 0 OR o.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
      ACCUM
        UINT unseen_ms = 0, BOOL found = FALSE,
        FOREACH (n, start_ms) IN @@first_use.get(a.id) DO
            IF @@own_seen.get(q.id).contains(n) THEN
                found = @@first_unseen.get(q.id).containsKey(n),
                unseen_ms = @@first_unseen.get(q.id).get(n)
            ELSE
                found = @@first_own.containsKey(q.id),
                unseen_ms = @@first_own.get(q.id)
            END,
            IF start_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms AND start_ms > q.joined_ms
              AND found AND unseen_ms < start_ms THEN
                @@first_use_known += (a.id -> n)
            END
        END;

    /* The caps: each expanded account's customer keeps its 8 newest links of each kind,
       each expanded account its 8 latest seen nodes of each kind. */
    KeptLinks = SELECT q FROM Owners:q
      POST-ACCUM
        UINT evidence = 0,
        FOREACH (n, start_ms) IN @@link_start.get(q.id) DO
            evidence = 0,
            IF @@known_link.get(q.id).containsKey(n) THEN
                evidence = @@known_link.get(q.id).get(n)
            END,
            IF @@any_last.get(q.id).containsKey(n)
              AND @@any_last.get(q.id).get(n) > evidence THEN
                evidence = @@any_last.get(q.id).get(n)
            END,
            IF @@ip_ids.contains(n) THEN
                q.@kept_ips += Ranked(evidence, n)
            ELSE
                q.@kept_devices += Ranked(evidence, n)
            END
        END;
    KeptLinksListed = SELECT q FROM Owners:q
      POST-ACCUM
        FOREACH x IN q.@kept_devices DO @@kept_links += (q.id -> x.id) END,
        FOREACH x IN q.@kept_ips DO @@kept_links += (q.id -> x.id) END;
    KeptSeen = SELECT a FROM Expanding:a
      POST-ACCUM
        FOREACH (n, last_ms) IN @@last_use.get(a.id) DO
            IF @@ip_ids.contains(n) THEN
                a.@kept_seen_ips += Ranked(last_ms, n)
            ELSE
                a.@kept_seen_devices += Ranked(last_ms, n)
            END
        END;
    KeptSeenListed = SELECT a FROM Expanding:a
      POST-ACCUM
        FOREACH x IN a.@kept_seen_devices DO @@kept_seen += (a.id -> x.id) END,
        FOREACH x IN a.@kept_seen_ips DO @@kept_seen += (a.id -> x.id) END;

    /* Each scored account's nodes that are no leaf; its co-user candidates by their newest
       evidence on them; the newest 48; and the deposit accounts they may bring. */
    ScoredOpen = SELECT a FROM Scored:a
      POST-ACCUM
        FOREACH n IN @@kept_links.get(@@owner_of.get(a.id)) DO
            IF NOT @@leaf_ids.contains(n) THEN @@s_open += (a.id -> n) END
        END,
        FOREACH n IN @@kept_seen.get(a.id) DO
            IF NOT @@leaf_ids.contains(n) THEN @@s_open += (a.id -> n) END
        END;
    CoUserEvidence = SELECT a FROM Scored:a
      POST-ACCUM
        UINT evidence = 0,
        FOREACH n IN @@s_open.get(a.id) DO
            FOREACH c IN @@candidates.get(n) DO
                IF c != @@owner_of.get(a.id) THEN
                    evidence = t_ms - lookback_ms,
                    IF @@known_link.get(c).containsKey(n)
                      AND @@known_link.get(c).get(n) > evidence THEN
                        evidence = @@known_link.get(c).get(n)
                    END,
                    IF @@dep_last.get(c).containsKey(n)
                      AND @@dep_last.get(c).get(n) > evidence THEN
                        evidence = @@dep_last.get(c).get(n)
                    END,
                    a.@candidate_evidence += (c -> evidence)
                END
            END
        END;
    CoUsersPicked = SELECT a FROM Scored:a
      POST-ACCUM
        FOREACH (c, evidence) IN a.@candidate_evidence DO
            a.@kept_co_users += Ranked(evidence, c)
        END;
    CoUsersListed = SELECT a FROM Scored:a
      POST-ACCUM
        FOREACH x IN a.@kept_co_users DO
            @@kept_co_users += (a.id -> x.id),
            FOREACH b IN @@deposit_accounts.get(x.id) DO @@co_user_deposit_ids += b END
        END;
    CoUserDeposits = to_vertex_set(@@co_user_deposit_ids, "Account");
    CoUserActive = SELECT b FROM CoUserDeposits:b
      -((Account_Initiated_Transaction>|Account_Received_Transaction>
        |Account_Sent_Zelle_Transfer>|Account_Received_Zelle_Transfer>):e)-
      (Payment_Transaction|Zelle_Transfer):p
      -((Transaction_From_Account>|Transaction_To_Account>
        |Transfer_From_Account>|Transfer_To_Account>):f)- Account:x
      WHERE p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - lookback_ms AND p.event_ts_ms < t_ms AND x != b
      ACCUM @@last_active += (b.id -> p.event_ts_ms);
    CoUserAccounts = SELECT a FROM Scored:a
      POST-ACCUM
        STRING best = "", UINT best_seen = 0, UINT best_active = 0, UINT seen_ms = 0,
        UINT active_ms = 0,
        FOREACH c IN @@kept_co_users.get(a.id) DO
            best = "", best_seen = 0, best_active = 0,
            FOREACH b IN @@deposit_accounts.get(c) DO
                seen_ms = 0, active_ms = 0,
                FOREACH n IN @@s_open.get(a.id) DO
                    IF @@last_use.get(b).containsKey(n) AND @@last_use.get(b).get(n) > seen_ms THEN
                        seen_ms = @@last_use.get(b).get(n)
                    END
                END,
                IF @@last_active.containsKey(b) THEN active_ms = @@last_active.get(b) END,
                IF best == "" OR seen_ms > best_seen
                  OR (seen_ms == best_seen AND seen_ms == 0 AND active_ms > best_active)
                  OR (seen_ms == best_seen AND (seen_ms > 0 OR active_ms == best_active)
                    AND b < best) THEN
                    best = b, best_seen = seen_ms, best_active = active_ms
                END
            END,
            IF best != "" THEN
                @@co_user_accounts += (a.id -> best),
                @@printed_accounts += best
            END
        END;

    /* Each subgraph's customers, nodes and accounts that may carry an edge. */
    ScoredCustomers = SELECT a FROM Scored:a
      POST-ACCUM
        IF @@owner_of.containsKey(a.id) THEN
            @@subgraph_customers += (a.id -> @@owner_of.get(a.id))
        END,
        FOREACH e IN @@expanded_of.get(a.id) DO
            IF @@owner_of.containsKey(e) THEN
                @@subgraph_customers += (a.id -> @@owner_of.get(e))
            END
        END,
        FOREACH c IN @@kept_co_users.get(a.id) DO
            FOREACH n IN @@s_open.get(a.id) DO
                IF @@link_start.get(c).containsKey(n) THEN
                    @@subgraph_customers += (a.id -> c)
                END
            END
        END;
    ScoredNodesKept = SELECT a FROM Scored:a
      POST-ACCUM
        FOREACH n IN @@kept_links.get(@@owner_of.get(a.id)) DO
            @@subgraph_nodes += (a.id -> n)
        END,
        FOREACH n IN @@kept_seen.get(a.id) DO @@subgraph_nodes += (a.id -> n) END,
        FOREACH e IN @@expanded_of.get(a.id) DO
            FOREACH n IN @@kept_links.get(@@owner_of.get(e)) DO
                @@subgraph_nodes += (a.id -> n)
            END,
            FOREACH n IN @@kept_seen.get(e) DO @@subgraph_nodes += (a.id -> n) END
        END;
    ScoredAccounts = SELECT a FROM Scored:a
      POST-ACCUM
        FOREACH b IN @@subgraph_accounts.get(a.id) DO
            IF b == a.id OR NOT @@hub_ids.contains(b) THEN @@s_accounts += (a.id -> b) END
        END,
        FOREACH b IN @@co_user_accounts.get(a.id) DO
            IF b == a.id OR NOT @@hub_ids.contains(b) THEN @@s_accounts += (a.id -> b) END
        END;
    Printed = SELECT a FROM Scored:a
      POST-ACCUM
        FOREACH c IN @@subgraph_customers.get(a.id) DO @@printed_customers += c END,
        FOREACH n IN @@subgraph_nodes.get(a.id) DO @@printed_nodes += n END;

    /* The edges. An enrolment edge and an owner-enrolment edge carry their customer's link:
       the time since its known start and since the latest payment seen on the node from an
       account the customer owns. A seen edge carries the account's uses of the node: how
       many, since the first when it is a known start, and since the last. */
    EnrolledEdges = SELECT a FROM Scored:a
      POST-ACCUM
        STRING owner = @@owner_of.get(a.id), BOOL start_present = FALSE, UINT start_ms = 0,
        BOOL seen_present = FALSE, UINT seen_ms = 0,
        FOREACH n IN @@kept_links.get(owner) DO
            start_present = @@known_link.get(owner).containsKey(n),
            start_ms = 0,
            IF start_present THEN start_ms = t_ms - @@known_link.get(owner).get(n) END,
            seen_present = @@any_last.get(owner).containsKey(n),
            seen_ms = 0,
            IF seen_present THEN seen_ms = t_ms - @@any_last.get(owner).get(n) END,
            @@enrolled += (a.id -> Enrolled(owner, n, start_present, start_ms, seen_present,
              seen_ms))
        END,
        FOREACH n IN @@s_open.get(a.id) DO
            FOREACH c IN @@subgraph_customers.get(a.id) DO
                IF @@link_start.get(c).containsKey(n) THEN
                    start_present = @@known_link.get(c).containsKey(n),
                    start_ms = 0,
                    IF start_present THEN start_ms = t_ms - @@known_link.get(c).get(n) END,
                    seen_present = @@any_last.get(c).containsKey(n),
                    seen_ms = 0,
                    IF seen_present THEN seen_ms = t_ms - @@any_last.get(c).get(n) END,
                    @@enrolled += (a.id -> Enrolled(c, n, start_present, start_ms,
                      seen_present, seen_ms))
                END
            END
        END;
    OwnerEnrolledEdges = SELECT a FROM Scored:a
      POST-ACCUM
        STRING owner = @@owner_of.get(a.id), STRING customer = "", BOOL start_present = FALSE,
        UINT start_ms = 0, BOOL seen_present = FALSE, UINT seen_ms = 0,
        FOREACH b IN @@customer_accounts.get(a.id) DO
            IF @@s_accounts.get(a.id).contains(b) THEN
                FOREACH n IN @@kept_links.get(owner) DO
                    start_present = @@known_link.get(owner).containsKey(n),
                    start_ms = 0,
                    IF start_present THEN start_ms = t_ms - @@known_link.get(owner).get(n) END,
                    seen_present = @@any_last.get(owner).containsKey(n),
                    seen_ms = 0,
                    IF seen_present THEN seen_ms = t_ms - @@any_last.get(owner).get(n) END,
                    @@owner_enrolled += (a.id -> OwnerEnrolled(b, n, start_present, start_ms,
                      seen_present, seen_ms))
                END
            END
        END,
        FOREACH e IN @@expanded_of.get(a.id) DO
            customer = @@owner_of.get(e),
            FOREACH n IN @@kept_links.get(customer) DO
                start_present = @@known_link.get(customer).containsKey(n),
                start_ms = 0,
                IF start_present THEN start_ms = t_ms - @@known_link.get(customer).get(n) END,
                seen_present = @@any_last.get(customer).containsKey(n),
                seen_ms = 0,
                IF seen_present THEN seen_ms = t_ms - @@any_last.get(customer).get(n) END,
                @@owner_enrolled += (a.id -> OwnerEnrolled(e, n, start_present, start_ms,
                  seen_present, seen_ms))
            END
        END,
        FOREACH n IN @@s_open.get(a.id) DO
            FOREACH (b, linked) IN @@node_link_accounts.get(n) DO
                IF @@s_accounts.get(a.id).contains(b) THEN
                    start_present = @@known_link.get(linked).containsKey(n),
                    start_ms = 0,
                    IF start_present THEN start_ms = t_ms - @@known_link.get(linked).get(n) END,
                    seen_present = @@any_last.get(linked).containsKey(n),
                    seen_ms = 0,
                    IF seen_present THEN seen_ms = t_ms - @@any_last.get(linked).get(n) END,
                    @@owner_enrolled += (a.id -> OwnerEnrolled(b, n, start_present, start_ms,
                      seen_present, seen_ms))
                END
            END
        END;
    SeenEdges = SELECT a FROM Scored:a
      POST-ACCUM
        BOOL first_present = FALSE, UINT first_ms = 0,
        FOREACH n IN @@kept_seen.get(a.id) DO
            first_present = @@first_use_known.get(a.id).contains(n),
            first_ms = 0,
            IF first_present THEN first_ms = t_ms - @@first_use.get(a.id).get(n) END,
            @@seen += (a.id -> Seen(a.id, n, @@uses.get(a.id).get(n), first_present, first_ms,
              t_ms - @@last_use.get(a.id).get(n)))
        END,
        FOREACH e IN @@expanded_of.get(a.id) DO
            FOREACH n IN @@kept_seen.get(e) DO
                first_present = @@first_use_known.get(e).contains(n),
                first_ms = 0,
                IF first_present THEN first_ms = t_ms - @@first_use.get(e).get(n) END,
                @@seen += (a.id -> Seen(e, n, @@uses.get(e).get(n), first_present, first_ms,
                  t_ms - @@last_use.get(e).get(n)))
            END
        END,
        FOREACH n IN @@s_open.get(a.id) DO
            FOREACH b IN @@node_senders.get(n) DO
                IF @@s_accounts.get(a.id).contains(b) THEN
                    first_present = @@first_use_known.get(b).contains(n),
                    first_ms = 0,
                    IF first_present THEN first_ms = t_ms - @@first_use.get(b).get(n) END,
                    @@seen += (a.id -> Seen(b, n, @@uses.get(b).get(n), first_present,
                      first_ms, t_ms - @@last_use.get(b).get(n)))
                END
            END
        END;

    /* The rows. A customer's co-users: those sharing a node with it that is no leaf, when
       each pair began sharing, and on which kinds of node; then its counts. A node's
       customers sharing it, and those whose sharing start is in the last 7 or 30 days. */
    CustomersListed = to_vertex_set(@@printed_customers, "Party");
    Pairs = SELECT q FROM CustomersListed:q
      POST-ACCUM
        UINT own_ms = 0, UINT other_ms = 0,
        FOREACH n IN @@link_current.get(q.id) DO
            IF NOT @@leaf_ids.contains(n) THEN
                FOREACH c IN @@node_users.get(n) DO
                    IF c != q.id AND (@@link_current.get(c).contains(n)
                      OR @@dep_recent.get(c).contains(n)) THEN
                        own_ms = @@share_start.get(q.id).get(n),
                        other_ms = @@share_start.get(c).get(n),
                        q.@pair_start += (c -> CASE WHEN own_ms > other_ms THEN own_ms
                          ELSE other_ms END),
                        IF @@ip_ids.contains(n) THEN
                            q.@ip_co_users += c
                        ELSE
                            q.@device_co_users += c
                        END
                    END
                END
            END
        END,
        FOREACH n IN @@dep_recent.get(q.id) DO
            IF NOT @@leaf_ids.contains(n) THEN
                FOREACH c IN @@node_users.get(n) DO
                    IF c != q.id AND (@@link_current.get(c).contains(n)
                      OR @@dep_recent.get(c).contains(n)) THEN
                        own_ms = @@share_start.get(q.id).get(n),
                        other_ms = @@share_start.get(c).get(n),
                        q.@pair_start += (c -> CASE WHEN own_ms > other_ms THEN own_ms
                          ELSE other_ms END),
                        IF @@ip_ids.contains(n) THEN
                            q.@ip_co_users += c
                        ELSE
                            q.@device_co_users += c
                        END
                    END
                END
            END
        END;
    CustomerRows = SELECT q FROM CustomersListed:q
      POST-ACCUM
        FOREACH n IN @@link_current.get(q.id) DO
            IF @@ip_ids.contains(n) THEN q.@ips_30d += 1 ELSE q.@devices_30d += 1 END
        END,
        FOREACH (n, start_ms) IN @@known_link.get(q.id) DO
            IF start_ms >= t_ms - 2592000000 THEN
                IF @@ip_ids.contains(n) THEN q.@new_ips_30d += 1 ELSE q.@new_devices_30d += 1 END
            END
        END,
        FOREACH (c, start_ms) IN q.@pair_start DO
            q.@co_users += 1,
            IF start_ms >= t_ms - 2592000000 THEN q.@new_co_users_30d += 1 END,
            IF q.@device_co_users.contains(c) AND q.@ip_co_users.contains(c) THEN
                q.@co_users_both += 1
            END
        END;
    DevicesListed = to_vertex_set(@@printed_nodes, "Device");
    IpsListed = to_vertex_set(@@printed_nodes, "IP");
    NodesListed = DevicesListed UNION IpsListed;
    NodeRows = SELECT d FROM NodesListed:d
      WHERE NOT d.@leaf
      POST-ACCUM
        FOREACH c IN @@node_users.get(d.id) DO
            IF @@link_current.get(c).contains(d.id) OR @@dep_recent.get(c).contains(d.id) THEN
                d.@customers_30d += 1
            END,
            IF @@share_start.get(c).get(d.id) >= t_ms - 604800000 THEN
                d.@new_customers_7d += 1
            END,
            IF @@share_start.get(c).get(d.id) >= t_ms - 2592000000 THEN
                d.@new_customers_30d += 1
            END
        END,
        d.@customers_90d += d.@crowd_customers.size(),
        d.@accounts_seen_30d += d.@seen_accounts.size(),
        d.@observed_only += d.@crowd_enrolled.size() == 0;
    AccountsListed = to_vertex_set(@@printed_accounts, "Account");
    Accounts = SELECT a FROM AccountsListed:a WHERE a.opened_ms < t_ms;

    PRINT "ok" AS status, "read_shared_identity-ccebbca1bdd2" AS version;
    PRINT CustomersListed[CustomersListed.id AS customer_id,
      CustomersListed.@accounts_owned AS accounts_owned,
      CustomersListed.@devices_30d AS devices_30d, CustomersListed.@ips_30d AS ips_30d,
      CustomersListed.@new_devices_30d AS new_devices_30d,
      CustomersListed.@new_ips_30d AS new_ips_30d, CustomersListed.@co_users AS co_users,
      CustomersListed.@new_co_users_30d AS new_co_users_30d,
      CustomersListed.@co_users_both AS co_users_both] AS customers;
    PRINT DevicesListed[DevicesListed.id AS node_id, DevicesListed.@leaf AS leaf,
      DevicesListed.@customers_30d AS customers_30d,
      DevicesListed.@customers_90d AS customers_90d,
      DevicesListed.@new_customers_7d AS new_customers_7d,
      DevicesListed.@new_customers_30d AS new_customers_30d,
      DevicesListed.@accounts_seen_30d AS accounts_seen_30d,
      DevicesListed.@payments_seen_30d AS payments_seen_30d,
      DevicesListed.@observed_only AS observed_only] AS devices;
    PRINT IpsListed[IpsListed.id AS node_id, IpsListed.@leaf AS leaf,
      IpsListed.@customers_30d AS customers_30d, IpsListed.@customers_90d AS customers_90d,
      IpsListed.@new_customers_7d AS new_customers_7d,
      IpsListed.@new_customers_30d AS new_customers_30d,
      IpsListed.@accounts_seen_30d AS accounts_seen_30d,
      IpsListed.@payments_seen_30d AS payments_seen_30d,
      IpsListed.@observed_only AS observed_only] AS ips;
    PRINT Accounts[Accounts.id AS account_id, Accounts.is_external AS is_external] AS accounts;
    PRINT @@subgraph_customers AS subgraph_customers;
    PRINT @@subgraph_nodes AS subgraph_nodes;
    PRINT @@co_user_accounts AS co_user_accounts;
    PRINT @@enrolled AS enrolled;
    PRINT @@owner_enrolled AS owner_enrolled;
    PRINT @@seen AS seen;
}
